or every guest). First recorded 2026-10-10 from RsvpWidget AS IT STOOD at origin/main 64746f064, BEFORE the reply card’s lines were drawn from a list (the RSVP stage’s ＋, drag and Group). Each case is the sha-256 and the byte length of the whole card’s HTML (react-dom/server renderToStaticMarkup); `inFull` keeps the reply’s own fieldset of two cases so a person can read it. `widgetSha256` is rsvp-widget.tsx at recording — compare with `git show 64746f064:\"apps/web/app/[slug]/_components/rsvp-widget.tsx\" | shasum -a 256`. Held by the-reply-card-is-todays-page.test.ts. Record again ONLY when the card is meant to change for every guest.",
